  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut potato into fries.\n• Place on lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Bake until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6620d9a5d7d86b487f183ffb-ef630958.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile grate carrot. Drain and rinse cannellini beans. Halve continental rolls.\n• When fries have 10 mins remaining, bake continental roll halves directly on a wire oven rack until heated through, 2-3 mins.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook cannellini beans until softened, 2-3 mins.\n• Stir in garlic seasoning and tomato paste and cook, until fragrant, 1 min.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6620d9a5d7d86b487f183ffb-a5a24aa4.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add the water, brown sugar and butter to the beans and simmer until slightly reduced, 1-2 mins.\n• Remove pan from heat and lightly mash beans with a potato masher or fork. Season to taste.\n• Remove rolls from oven and place on a lined oven tray. Top with bean mixture and sprinkle with Cheddar cheese. Bake until golden and melted, 5 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6620d9a5d7d86b487f183ffb-2352f34d.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, combine carrot, salad leaves and a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil. Season.\n• Divide cheesy baked beans rolls between plates. Serve with carrot salad and fries.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6620d9a5d7d86b487f183ffb-5226dfcb.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
